I just wanna make
sure the direction.

1100
00:49:35,873 --> 00:49:39,410
That guard won't
be back right away.
Yes, that's it.

1101
00:49:39,410 --> 00:49:43,448
Dean, I may never get
a chance to say this again.

1102
