1115
00:50:31,028 --> 00:50:33,064
I splashed some water
on my pits.

1116
00:50:33,064 --> 00:50:34,732
- Did you find anything?
- Nope.

1117
00:50:34,732 --> 00:50:37,135
I listened to two guards
