- Are you surprised?

1699
01:19:55,291 --> 01:19:57,861
Very funny. Don't just
stand there. Try and find
something to open this with.

1700
01:19:57,861 --> 01:20:00,729
This would be the kind
of blood hunt I get in on.

1701
01:20:02,098 --> 01:20:04,200
After we get it,
what are we gonna do?

1702
01:20:04,200 --> 01:20:06,369
We're gonna try
and get out of here
and find the boat.

1703
01:20:06,369 --> 01:20:09,873
Thank goodness.
I don't wanna stay here
any longer than we have to.

1704
01:20:09,873 --> 01:20:11,607
Yeah, that oughta do the trick.

1705
01:20:11,607 --> 01:20:13,609
That was almost as hard
as the time I went scouting.

1706
01:20:13,609 --> 01:20:15,278
Shut up.

1707
01:20:23,019 --> 01:20:26,455
Get all the way out there
and my laxative kicks in.

1708
01:20:28,457 --> 01:20:30,894
All quiet, sir.

1709
01:20:30,894 --> 01:20:32,896
Neck broke.

1710
01:20:32,896 --> 01:20:35,164
Get what you pay for I guess.

1711
01:20:35,164 --> 01:20:37,967
Wait. I think I have
a neck in here somewhere.

1712
01:20:37,967 --> 01:20:40,036
Oh, yes.

1713
01:20:40,036 --> 01:20:43,072
Had a great job
as an actuary downtown,

1714
01:20:43,072 --> 01:20:47,043
but no, gotta come out
and buy an island.

1715
