without it.

1720
01:21:03,826 --> 01:21:05,895
- I know.
- Somebody's coming.

1721
01:21:05,895 --> 01:21:06,996
Let's get out of here.

1722
01:21:06,996 --> 01:21:09,732
Scooby-Doo,
the motion picture.

1723
01:21:09,732 --> 01:21:14,203
Shh. I can't stop laughing.
( laughing )

1724
01:21:14,203 --> 01:21:18,041
We should be thankful for his
smoking jacket or else he'd
be walking around

1725
01:21:18,041 --> 01:21:21,010
- in his underwear.
- Hoo-ooo-oo!

1726
01:21:21,010 --> 01:21:24,380
I think I'll settle in
with some Erma Bombeck.

1727
01:21:24,380 --> 01:21:27,183
Maybe a little
schnitzelbaum for dinner.

1728
01:21:27,183 --> 01:21:29,085
I hope I didn't kill the cook.

1729
01:21:34,924 --> 01:21:38,261
This guy looks like
a sockeye salmon
about to spawn.

1730
01:21:39,428 --> 01:21:42,065
Those darn Menendez boys.

1731
01:21:44,167 --> 01:21:46,702
Oh, good, my lingerie
is still here.

1732
01:21:48,237 --> 01:21:50,173
Feel so violated.

1733
01:21:52,942 --> 01:21:54,243
Manos.

1734
01:21:55,478 --> 01:21:57,646
Wish the bear
would put on some pants.

1735
01:21:57,646 --> 01:22:00,849
No cookies, not now,
not ever, never.

1736
01:22:06,990 --> 01:22:10,126
You know,
I could sublet this.

1737
01:22:12,061 --> 01:22:15,798
( sighs )
Maybe I do have
room for a pool table.

1738
01:22:17,233 --> 01:22:21,537
* But a cave is not a home *

1739
01:22:21,537 --> 01:22:24,140
This is the biggest bathroom
I've ever seen.

1740
01:22:26,976 --> 01:22:29,912
Ladies and gentlemen,
Spalding Gray.

1741
01:22:29,912 --> 01:22:32,681
Well than, I'm flattered

1742
