that someone should 
 want a further look 
 at my little souvenirs.

1743
01:22:36,452 --> 01:22:39,255
No one else has ever 
 come back a second time...

1744
01:22:39,255 --> 01:22:40,323
Maybe I'm overcharging.

1745
01:22:40,323 --> 01:22:41,424
...alive.

1746
01:22:41,424 --> 01:22:43,626
Hello.

1747
01:22:43,626 --> 01:22:47,030
