1776
01:24:03,439 --> 01:24:05,708
I got you. I got you!
I got you!

1777
01:24:05,708 --> 01:24:08,211
A single sound.

1778
01:24:08,211 --> 01:24:10,413
- A single sound.
- A single sound.

1779
01:24:10,413 --> 01:24:12,115
Stay just where you are.

1780
01:24:12,115 --> 01:24:14,550
You guys are pathetic.
Look at you.

1781
01:24:14,550 --> 01:24:18,221
That's far enough, fellla.
Don't come any closer.

1782
01:24:18,221 --> 01:24:21,724
