Should have had a tech
rehearse the line. Ah.

1817
01:25:52,415 --> 01:25:54,583
You, over to my chair

1818
01:25:54,583 --> 01:25:56,485
And throw the last switch.

1819
01:25:56,485 --> 01:25:58,053
Move quickly, quickly.

1820
01:25:58,053 --> 01:26:01,190
Finally Pete's the AV geek
he always wanted to be.

1821
01:26:02,925 --> 01:26:04,460
Balleau:
 Hurry, the last switch.

1822
